<string>macOS - Application Firewall (Enforced)</string>
<key>PayloadDescription</key>
<string>Forces the built-in macOS Application Firewall on, with stealth mode enabled. Built from Apple's official device-management payload reference (com.apple.security.firewall) — not part of Microsoft Defender for Endpoint, this is Apple's native OS firewall.</string>
